{
  "id": "ISA.38",
  "number": "38",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 38",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oborwaire bw’omorwoti Hezekia na okogwenigwa kwaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 20:1-11; 2 Amg 32:24-26)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko aria Hezekia akarwara, akaba ang’e nogokwa. Isaya omobani, mosinto bw’Amosi, agacha asare, akamoteebia, “Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Ebeke ang’e, amo nenyomba yao, ekiagera aye goika okwe, tokogwena.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekia akaonchora obosio bwaye gochia ase enyasi, agasaba Omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabora, “bono Omonene nagosoroire, inyora buna nabeire ngokobwatia ase obwegenwa, na ase enkoro yane yonsi, naende nakorire ayare amaronge ase obosio bwao.” Erio. Hezekia akarera nobororo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ring’ana ri’Omonene rigacha ase Isaya, rikamoteebia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Irana oteebie Hezekia ng’a inche Omonene, Nyasae o Daudi sokoro yaye, nigo ngoteeba iga: Naigure ogosaba kwao, narorire amariga ao. Rora, nakomentire emiaka ikomi na etano ase obogima bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningotoorie aye amo nomochie oyo, korwa ase okoboko kw’omorwoti bw’Abaasuri; ning’egere omochie oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eke nakio ekemanyererio asore korwa ase Omonene, ng’a naikeranie amang’ana ayio atebiire:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora, ase ekerengero gie chinsa ki’Ahasi ninkore omorengari oria otambeire ekero erioba riereerire oirane gochia magega ebitambokero ikomi.” Ase ayio erioba rikairania omorengari oye ebitambokero ikomi ase ekerengero keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega Hezekia, omorwoti bw’Abayuda, kagwenire korwa ase oborwaire bwaye, akariika ogoteera oko:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo narengereretie ng’a ngochia gokwa inde ase emiaka y’oboke bwane;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ningende ase ebiita bi’aase abakuure,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "naurirwe emiaka yane yatigarete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngateeba, “Tinkorora Omonene naende ase ense y’abare moyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gose korora monto onde bwensi ase aba bamenyete ase ense eye y’obosiru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obomenyo bwane bwatagoirwe na korusigwa ase ’nde buna eema y’omorisia,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "naringire obogima bwane buna omooroisia ebitambaa akobiringa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nabutoirwe korwa ase egekorero;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekero botaraira, aye nigo okoeria obogima bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nkorera ase obotuko bwonsi ng’a nkonywe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene obunire amauga aane buna endo ekobuna ebi yaitire;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekero botaraira ere nigo akoeria obogima bwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nkorera buna egesingororo gose ebarara;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nigo nkweumia buna riruma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amaiso aane arosire ase okorigereria gochia igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, nigo inde nemechando emenene, indwanerere!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inki bono ngokwana?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omonene nere okwanire nainche,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nere omonyene okorire amang’ana aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase igo nintaare inde nobokanyeku ase emiaka yane yonsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ase engencho y’obororo bwonsi bw’omoyo one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, ase okoba namang’ana buna ayio, abanto nigo bakoba moyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na obogima bw’omoika one nao bore ase ayio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na bono ingwenie kegima na onkore imbe moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naama! Nigo narenge nobororo obonge,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "na obororo obwo bokandetera omorembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ase obwanchani bwao gwatooririe omoyo one korwa ase engoro y’obosareku;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "gwatugutire ebibe biane bionsi gochia magega yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abare aase abakuure tibagokoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abwo bakuure tibakogotogia;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "abwo bakogenda ase chimbeera ime tibagosemeria obwegenwa bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto ore moyo nere orakoiranerie ng’a mbuya mono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "buna inche ngokoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono ase rituko ria reero;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ise abana nere agokora obwegenwa bwao bwamanyekana ase abana baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene nantoorie;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ase ayio ntobe togoteera amatera, ase okobugia amakano aane,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ase obogima bwaito bwonsi, agwo ase enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Isaya konya oteebire iga: “Tiga baimokie ribomba ri’amako, baribeke ase rigumba ria Hezekia, erinde agwene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boigo Hezekia konya oboririe iga: “Nkemanyererio ki gekonyorokia ng’a ningende ase enyomba y’Omonene?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
